      "translation_quote": "بقيت المقاطع كاملة بالإنجليزية، ومنها: “This is not comfortable, God, and I’m afraid.”؛ “Jehoshaphat laid his fear aside, set himself to seek the Lord, and proclaimed a fast throughout all the land of Judah – verse 3.”؛ “O our God, wilt thou not judge them?”؛ “Yes, God, I am nothing in the grand scheme of things.”؛ “And all Judah stood before the LORD”؛ “…Be not afraid nor dismayed”؛ “Tomorrow go ye down against them”؛ “And Jehoshaphat bowed his head”؛ “And they rose early in the morning”؛ “And when they began to sing and to praise”."
